# Phase 3 T2 PixelDiff: one dolpic/0 frame at a fixed tick per pre-written build/Route/<name>/appdata/Sunshine/settings.ini.
# Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1; SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE=0.5 (env scale) or
# SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE= (route.py removes it: the INI resolution_scale decides).
# Evidence: p.png (window size; FSR1/bilinear output of the internal frame), [render] upscaler=, log line at the shot tick.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=240
log
shot p.png
wait frames=30
end
